  <participating-org role="4" type="90">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sisterhood for Development Associat</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">VivNcaug(Sisterhood for Development) is a non-profit group to support the well-being of women and girls to reach their full potential, break the cycle of poverty and raise their status in society.

Vision: To achieve an equitable world where ethnic women and girls have equal access to necessary opportunities and resources to empower themselves and shape society.

Mission: To support the spiritual, emotional, social, physical, economic wellbeing of women and girls to reach their educational goals and full potential in order to break the cycle of poverty and raise their status in society.

Goal: Build a community of socially aware and economically empowered women working together to narrow the socioeconomic divide</narrative>
